  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Protection sphere, War sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you create a ward, you may spend a spell point to add the effects of a totem ability you have to it. If you do, the entire area of your ward is a totem (even if your totem would normally be smaller), and your rallies work within this ward as if they were within any other totem that you created.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/protection#toc126\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
